; An elided posting has one row per commodity of the balance, in commodity-name order.
2026-01-01 three commodities
    a      1 b
    b      2 Z
    c      3 a
    d      4 $
    e      5 €
    f      6 "E F"
    g      7 É
    h
2026-01-02 elided posting in the middle
    a      4 X
    b
    c     -9 Z
    d      7 Y
; Zero amounts of the balance: all zero gives one row, the smallest named commodity.
2026-01-03 every commodity nets to zero
    a      1 B
    b     -1 B
    c      1 A
    d     -1 A
    e
2026-01-04 zeros are left out when another amount is not zero
    a      1 B
    b     -1 B
    c      2 A
    d      3 C
    e     -3 C
    f
2026-01-05 a commodity-less zero
    a      1
    b     -1
    c      1 Z
    d     -1 Z
    e
2026-01-06 only the commodity-less amount
    a      1
    b     -1
    c
; Assignments.
2026-01-07 holdings to assign over
    n      5 X
    n      7 Y
    q
2026-01-08 total assignment zeroes two commodities
    n      == 0
    q
2026-01-09 a difference of zero leaves an empty amount
    n      = 0 X
    m      0 X
2026-01-10 and so does an elided posting after it
    n      = 0 X
    m
; The empty commodity sorts first.
2026-01-11 a bare number and a named commodity
    a      1
    b      3 B
    c
2026-01-12 zeros of a bare number and a named commodity
    a      1
    b     -1
    c      1 B
    d     -1 B
    e
